==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The 6th Angel (Enemy)|The 6th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

